  // Entity types shared by the host (CIGI short type, DIS type, default speed) and the IG (model + IR signature).
  //  model:            .glb / .gltf / .fbx / .obj path relative to this file. Empty or missing => procedural placeholder.
  //  modelScale:       applied to the imported model (several free models are not authored in meters).
  //  modelRotationDeg: Godot Euler XYZ degrees so the nose points to Godot -Z with +Y up.
  //                    Models exported from Blender with the nose at -Y (most aircraft here) need [0, 180, 0].
  //  modelOffsetFrdM:  shifts the scaled model (body FRD meters: forward, right, down) so the entity origin sits at the
  //                    fuselage centerline / CG. Camera mounts in sensors.json are relative to that origin.
  //  hotspots:         IR hotspots in body FRD meters relative to the entity origin.
  //  classId/className: YOLO class written to truth and dataset labels.
  //  dis:              SISO-REF-010 entity type. Category/domain values are best-effort defaults: verify for your exercise.
